flowchart TD
    A[Student Presents QR at Gate] --> B[Operator Scanner / Turnstile Reader]

    B --> C[Decode QR Token<br/>Extract: personId, tokenSignature]
    C --> D[Validate Cryptographic Signature]
    D --> E{Valid Signature?}
    E -->|Invalid| F[Reject: "Invalid QR Code"]
    F --> G[Play Error Sound -> Red Flash]
    G --> H[Alert Supervisor]
    H --> I[Return to Scanner]

    E -->|Valid| J[Lookup Person<br/>GET /api/persons/:id]
    J --> K{Person Found?}
    K -->|Not Found| L[Reject: "Person Not Registered"]
    L --> I
    
    K -->|Found| M{Student Type Check}

    %% Day Scholar Flow
    M -->|Day Scholar| N[Check Campus Hours<br/>GET /api/gates/:gateId/schedule]
    N --> O{Current Time Within Hours?}
    O -->|Yes: Within Schedule| P[Auto-Determine Direction]
    P --> Q{Previous Scan State}
    Q -->|Was Outside| R[Log ENTRY<br/>Status: CAMPUS]
    Q -->|Was Inside / First Scan| S[Log EXIT<br/>Status: OFF CAMPUS]
    R --> T[Play Success Chime]
    S --> T
    T --> U[Unlock Turnstile]
    U --> V[Display: "Welcome [Name]" or "Goodbye [Name]"]
    V --> W[Notify Parent: Entry/Exit Update]
    W --> X[Return to Scanner]

    O -->|No: Outside Hours| Y[Check Early/Late Pass]
    Y --> Z{Valid Pass Exists?}
    Z -->|Yes| P
    Z -->|No| AA[Reject: "Outside Campus Hours"]
    AA --> AB[Play Warning Sound]
    AB --> AC[Display: "Campus Closed - No Pass"]
    AC --> X

    %% Hosteler OUT Flow
    M -->|Hosteler OUT| AD{Active Approved Pass?}
    AD -->|YES: Valid Window| AE[Verify Pass: Start <= Now <= End]
    AE -->|Pass Valid| AF[Log EXIT<br/>Status: ON_PASS]
    AF --> AG[Notify Parent via SMS/WhatsApp<br/>"Ward has left campus, Pass: [Type]" ]
    AG --> AH[Notify Warden<br/>"Student X exited on pass" ]
    AH --> AI[Start Pass Expiry Timer]
    AI --> AJ[Allow Exit -> Unlock Turnstile]
    AJ --> X
    
    AD -->|NO PASS| AK[Reject: "No Valid Pass"]
    AK --> AL[Display: "Get Approval Before Exiting"]
    AL --> AM[Button: "Request Emergency Pass"]
    AM --> AN[Navigate to Pass Request Kiosk]

    AD -->|YES: Pass Expired| AO[Reject: "Pass Expired"]
    AO --> AN

    %% Hosteler IN Flow (Returning from Pass)
    M -->|Hosteler IN| AP{Check Return Status}
    AP -->|Returning on Active Pass| AQ[Log ENTRY<br/>Status: HOSTEL]
    AQ --> AR{Check Curfew}
    AR -->|On Time| AS[Allow Entry -> Unlock Turnstile]
    AR -->|Late / Post-Curfew| AT[Log as LATE BREACH]
    AT --> AU[Alert Warden + Parent<br/>"Curfew Breach: [Name] returned late"]
    AU --> AS
    
    AP -->|Not on Pass (Normal Return)| AV[Log ENTRY<br/>Status: HOSTEL]
    AV --> AR

    %% Error & Alert Scenarios
    AW[Blacklisted Student] --> AX[Block Entry/Exit]
    AX --> AY[Alert Security + Supervisor]
    AY --> AZ[Log Security Incident]

    BA[Health/Medical Alert] --> BB[Allow with Escort Required]
    BB --> BC[Notify Medical Station]
    BC --> X

    %% Post-Scan Processing
    X --> BD[Update Live Feed]
    BD --> BE[Refresh Dashboard Stats]
    BE --> BF{Click "Done" or Auto-Reset}
    BF --> A